      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَلَّسٌ</span></b>  A sword <i>having wavy marks resembling
a chain:</i> occurring in a verse of Ibn-Kilábeh ElHudhalee, as some relate it; but accord. to others,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُلَسْلَس</span>, formed by transposition from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَلْسَل</span>.
(TA.)

